  "description": "The ALLGRIT Ti-X is Ribble’s premium titanium gravel bike, built for riders who measure their adventures in moments, not miles. Crafted from 3Al–2.5V titanium and enhanced with precision 3D-printed lugs, it’s engineered to go the distance, carry your load, and remain composed across any terrain. This premium build pairs our lightweight, aerodynamic titanium frame with SRAM’s feature-rich and fully wireless SRAM Rival AXS E1 drivetrain, reliable DT Swiss G 1800 wheels, smooth-rolling 45mm Schwalbe G-One tyres, and the comfort-focused Selle Italia Model X saddle. The Ribble ALLGRIT TI-X is also available with the optional RockShox Rudy Ultimate suspension fork upgrade, delivering enhanced comfort, control, and confidence when the gravel turns rough and the trails get technical.",
